#! ia 1.0

@schema approval-rule
  lowers to governance
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have demand
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    must have meaning.answers as text
    may have demand.words as list of id "The words of the records covered."
    may have demand.kinds as list of id in [governance, contract, definition, template, check, policy, binding]
    may have demand.paths as list of text "Repository-relative source-path prefixes."
    may have demand.pieces as id in [unrecognised]
    must have demand.quorum as number "Distinct approvers needed, at least 1."
    may have demand.from as list of text "Account identifiers; absent means the approvers of the record's workspace and of its ancestors."
    may have demand.via as list of id in [desk, slack]
    may have demand.key-kind as id in [service-held, person-held]
    may have demand.staleness as id in [unchanged-inputs, current-revision]
    may have demand.merge as id in [person, automatic]
